                </div>

                <div class="service-card fade-in">
                    <div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-bullhorn"></i></div>
                    <h3>Digital Marketing</h3>
                    <p>Reach your target audience with strategic digital marketing campaigns across multiple channels. Maximize ROI with our data-driven approach.</p>
                    <ul class="feature-list">
                        <li>Social media strategy & management</li>
                        <li>PPC & paid advertising</li>
                        <li>Email marketing campaigns</li>
                        <li>Content marketing strategy</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="service-card fade-in">
                    <div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-paint-brush"></i></div>
                    <h3>Web Design & Development</h3>
                    <p>Create stunning, responsive websites that not only look beautiful but also drive conversions and provide exceptional user experiences.</p>
                    <ul class="feature-list">
                        <li>Responsive web design</li>
